OL,3,GNEWSAMayor claims speed camera remark
OL,4,A'tongue in cheek'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Mayor of Greater Lincolnshire has
OL,7,Finsisted comments she made about
OL,8,Fwanting to get rid of speed cameras
OL,9,Fwere "a tongue in cheek remark".
OL,11,FDame Andrea Jenkyns shared a video on
OL,12,Fsocial media in which she appeared to
OL,13,Fsuggest speed cameras should be removed
OL,14,Fwhen powers from the
OL,15,Fsoon-to-be-abolished police and crime
OL,16,Fcommissioner (PCC) role were
OL,17,Ftransferred to the mayor.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
