OL,3,GNEWSAMayor claims speed camera remark
OL,4,A'tongue in cheek'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn her video ` captioned "speed cameras
OL,7,Fhave been put on notice" ` she said:
OL,8,F"I'm at the highways conference in
OL,9,FBirmingham and there's some speed
OL,10,Fcameras.
OL,12,F"When I'm police and crime
OL,13,Fcommissioner, I want to get rid of
OL,14,Fthese."
